n: 3.11.1.2
name: flat-phrase-rules
kind: observation
is: Every rule in the five host-language files is one flat sequence of quoted tokens and typed holes (name, int, string; Python also float, bytes and fstring). No rule holds alternation, repetition, an optional part or a reference to another rule, and no file defines the rule-reference constructor. A Go function is readable only with an empty body or with exactly the body return a + b.
status: observed
