n: 3.11.1.3
name: python-file
kind: observation
is: The Python rule file adds a token scanner, a layout step with a fixed dedent of 4 and a statement grouper before its 176 rules. Eleven rules cover eleven binary operators between two names, and the rule sample-module matches the token sequence of one specific sample file. No file outside the grammar file calls python-parse-module or any pybmf name.
status: observed
