n: 3.11.2.3
name: cursor-engine-particulars
kind: observation
is: The old body's home language grammar, form-bml.fk, runs on the cursor engine with 84 lines naming rule3 and one 17-row operator table. Parts of that language sit inside the engine: every primitive skips only // and /* */ comments, the keyword edge uses the bmlname class, the chain operation builds $bml-slice calls and the bind template builds $bml-typed calls.
status: observed
