name: name-table-two-copies
kind: observation
is: The cursor engine's table of blueprint names is kept in two hand-held copies. bmf-core.fk answers a name missing from its copy with category 0.0.0.0 and no report, so a parsed node and a constructed node with identical children get different identities. The file's own comment records this for the natural-language names.
