n: 3.11.2.6
name: reverse-yields-tokens
kind: observation
is: The reverse of an old host rule returns a list of token objects; the five files hold 209 such source closures. No function joining tokens into text was found in engine.fk, source-compiler.fk or compiler.fk, and the Go, Rust and Prolog files hold no text scanner. A rule with no reverse returns the token span its object was parsed from.
status: observed
