n: 3.11.9.1
name: category-per-language
kind: finding
is: Drop per-language node categories such as GO-BMF and PY-BMF. Node identity is category plus children, so equivalent statements of two languages get different nodes above the leaf. Where two category numbers coincide, as TypeScript and Go do on 631 to 637, an equal node would follow from the numbering and not from shared meaning.
status: inferred
conf: high
src: 2.19.11#527-528
