n: 3.11.9.2
name: closures-over-tokens
kind: finding
is: Drop the emit and source closures written per rule, and token objects as a grammar's input and output. Each closure pair writes one mapping twice by hand, and only a round-trip test per rule checks that the pair agrees. One template read in both directions replaces both closures, and a lens takes text in and gives text out.
status: inferred
conf: high
